// T31b: Temporal `Always (... => Next ...)` and `WeakUntil` verified over finite domain!
Fact clerk Identified by Clerk.
Fact step-state Identified by Init, Settled.
Fact current Identified by step-state.

Act settle Actor clerk
  Holds when current(Init)
  Creates current(Settled)
  Terminates current(Init).

Property settle-transitions-to-settled
  When Always (current(Init) => Next current(Settled)).

Property weak-until-settled
  When WeakUntil(current(Init), current(Settled)).

+current(Init).
